          "filename": "Chile - Cochamó climbing 70 - climbing in Paloma (6873766448).jpg",
          "caption": "Pete taking a turn on the first slabby pitch of 'En la Sande de los Gigantos'. \nThe route runs out up the slab (with a single bolt) to the crack, then curves left under the ceiling and follows lines all the way up. \n\nIt looked like a gorgeous climb, although our other group only got as high as the 3rd pitch, so we don't know how the top half is.",
          "alt": "Pete taking a turn on the first slabby pitch of 'En la Sande de los Gigantos'. \nThe route runs out up the slab (with a single bolt) to the crack, then curves left under the ceiling and follows lines all the way up. \n\nIt looked like a gorgeous climb, although our other group only got as high as the 3rd pitch, so we don't know how the top half is.",
